ose not  to talk to somebody about it  either for financial reasons for reasons  of stigma associated with seeking out a  therapist and I think it's really  important to do everything you can to  get past that because it's really  important to talk to someone when you  feel like that's the right thing to do  and what better help calm provides is  number one  the elimination of the stigma that could  be associated with it you work through  video phone whichever method is best for  you  you also will be able to save money  compared to seeing an in-person  therapist and it is so easy to get  started that I encourage you to go to  better help calm slash Pakman a few  questions that you answer which will get  you paired up with a therapist that  meets your needs you can always switch  to somebody else if you don't feel as  though the match is a good fit and it is  something that everybody should have  access to go to better help calm slash  Pakman it's easy to sign up it's easy to  get started we've put a link in the  description if you're watching on  YouTube and once again that website is  better help calm /pa K M a.m.
 

